OL,3,GNEWSAThe assistance dogs 'serving those
OL,4,Awho served us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Air Force veteran has said his
OL,7,Fassistance dog has made "a lot of
OL,8,Fdifference to my enjoyment".
OL,10,FMarine is one of the specially trained
OL,11,Fdogs that Hampshire-based charity
OL,12,FHounds for Heroes provides for
OL,13,Fphysically disabled serving and former
OL,14,Fmembers of HM Armed Forces and UK
OL,15,Femergency services.
OL,17,FBrian Holland, who lives in
OL,18,FLittlehampton, applied for one of their
OL,19,Fdogs when he retired permanently and
OL,20,Fsaid its trainers could update Marine's
OL,21,Fskills when his needs changed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
